c             2012

....

I want to fill column Name with values from vector names<-c("Joh", "Mary") so for every city and every year I will have an occurrence of name.

For example I want to see :

City     Year       Name

a          2011        John

b           2011        John

c           2011        John

a           2012           John

b            2012         John

c             2012          John

......

and so on for Mary etc..

